    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "you say i have the power to choose how it ends... but that sounds so heavy. like, are you saying it's actually okay to just... stop? to not wait for the collapse to finish me off, but to just leave before it gets even uglier? it feels like choosing to leave is the only way to keep some kind of dignity left.",
